# fixtures/i123-width -- the REAL Lotus 1-2-3 Release 2.2 driven under DOSBox-X
# 2024.03.01 (bead initech-3qtt, B06: a column wider than the worksheet area).
# Driver: ../lotus123-decomp/tools/mint_drive.sh (lotus123-decomp 5ec1459),
# config = its mint/smoke_ref.conf with C: mounted on a scratch COPY of
# mint/work_ref (123.EXE md5 7f46c7eccab7c9ecb42e69a29fb16a9e); nothing saved.
# Each "shot NAME" is NAME.png beside this file (720x400, 9x16 cells: the
# 80-column screen, row border chars 0..3, worksheet area chars 4..75 = 72).
# Read: A wider than 72 (76, 77, 80, 240) shows clipped to the 72-character
# area -- letter centred at char 39, pointer chars 4..75, a number right-
# aligned at char 74, ^Mid at 38..40, a long label cut at char 75; a later
# column shows only WHOLE (11_w67: no B beside a 67-wide A); Right from the
# wide A puts B first (06), Left brings A back first (07, 15). Captured
# 2026-10-23 by the i123cells lane; the status-line clock is the host clock.
sleep 8
key Escape
type 1
key Return
type /wcs72
key Return
sleep 0.6
shot 01_w72
key Right
sleep 0.6
shot 02_w72_right
key Left
sleep 0.6
type /wcs76
key Return
sleep 0.6
shot 03_w76
type /wcs77
key Return
sleep 0.6
shot 04_w77
type /wcs240
key Return
sleep 0.6
shot 05_w240
key Right
sleep 0.6
shot 06_w240_right
key Left
sleep 0.6
shot 07_w240_left
key Down
sleep 0.6
shot 08_w240_down
end
